sequenceDiagram
    actor User as "👤 User"
    participant App as "Blazor WASM App"
    participant API as "Minimal API"
    participant AI as "AI Services"
    participant Data as "Table Storage"

    User->>App: Login
    App->>API: POST /analyze
    API->>AI: Vision + OpenAI + Gemini
    AI-->>API: Result
    API-->>App: ImageAnalysisResponse
    App-->>User: Display result
    User->>API: Save to gallery
    API->>Data: Persist UserImage
